<% content_for :title, "About Voterr — Plex movie-night voting" %>
<% content_for :description, "Voterr is a hosted Plex movie-night voting app by Frank Johnette. Guests join by name and never log into Plex. Open source on GitHub." %>

<main class="landing-doc">
  <header class="landing-doc-header">
    <p class="landing-bento-label">About</p>
    <h1 class="landing-headline landing-doc-title">Plex movie-night voting, without the group chat argument</h1>
    <p class="landing-text-muted landing-doc-lead">
      Voterr turns your Plex library into a shared shortlist so everyone gets a say and movie night actually starts on time.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="landing-doc-grid">
    <section class="landing-doc-card">
      <p class="landing-bento-label">Built for the couch</p>
      <h2 class="landing-headline landing-doc-heading">A hosted way to pick</h2>
      <p>
        Connect Plex with OAuth, create a room, and invite friends with one link. Guests vote without a Plex account.
        When everyone likes the same title, that movie wins.
      </p>
      <p>
        Voterr is open source, built by
        <%= link_to "Frank Johnette", SeoHelper::AUTHOR_URL, rel: "author me", class: "landing-inline-link" %>,
        and designed to keep the group focused on watching something together — not on Docker Compose files or pasted tokens.
      </p>
      <p>
        <%= link_to "View the source on GitHub", SeoHelper::GITHUB_REPO_URL, class: "landing-inline-link" %>
        ·
        <%= link_to "Compare Voterr with other Plex pickers", compare_path, class: "landing-inline-link" %>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-doc-card">
      <p class="landing-bento-label">Five simple steps</p>
      <ol class="landing-step-list">
        <li><span>01</span>Host connects their Plex library</li>
        <li><span>02</span>Create a voting session</li>
        <li><span>03</span>Invite friends with a link</li>
        <li><span>04</span>Guests join by name and vote</li>
        <li><span>05</span>Watch the winner in Plex</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="landing-doc-note">
    Movie metadata is provided by TMDB. Voterr is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.
    Voterr is not affiliated with Plex, Inc. or with voterr.io.
  </p>
</main>
